Dependency references (not bundled asset licenses)
-------------------------------------------------
The generator pyproject.toml declares these install-time dependencies:
pydantic, numpy, jinja2, markdown, matplotlib, pillow, pypdf, pyyaml, click,
openai, httpx, azure-identity, python-dotenv, openpyxl, pandas, seaborn, scipy,
reportlab, PyMuPDF, and playwright.
Optional fallback renderers: weasyprint, xhtml2pdf.
Development/build tooling: pytest, build, hatchling.
Playwright is pinned to 1.58.0; the package requires Python 3.10 or later.
Other versions and constraints are maintained in pyproject.toml.
The experiment guide documents its separate dependency requirements.

Installing these dependencies retrieves upstream packages; they are not vendored
by this source tree. Playwright's Chromium browser is obtained through external
browser setup, not provided by this source tree. These components retain their
own licenses and notices. Check the final wheel/source archive and resolved
dependency licenses before distribution; this file does not claim dependency
redistribution clearance.

